sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant Client as DSH or API client
  participant Orchestrator
  participant Jev
  participant Native as DSH native adapters
  participant Python as academic-search FastAPI
  Client->>Orchestrator: searchResearch(query, mode)
  Orchestrator->>Orchestrator: Check credentials and capabilities
  opt Jev mode and key configured
    Orchestrator->>Jev: Classify query and provider preference
    Jev-->>Orchestrator: Domain, primary provider, confidence
  end
  alt Valid Jev decision
    Orchestrator->>Orchestrator: Gate proposed provider bundle
  else Unavailable or low confidence
    Orchestrator->>Orchestrator: Select deterministic rules bundle
  end
  par JS native provider
    Orchestrator->>Native: Search one selected provider
    Native-->>Orchestrator: Ranked source records
  and Python-only provider
    Orchestrator->>Python: POST /v1/papers/search with one provider
    Python-->>Orchestrator: Ranked source records
  end
  Orchestrator->>Orchestrator: Identity match and version relations
  Orchestrator->>Orchestrator: Independent-source RRF and provenance
  Orchestrator-->>Client: Canonical papers and bibliography status
